5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair way to allocate these spaces. I'll look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows to see the actual conditions.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I'll check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station to understand the financial context and external alternatives.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I will examine the five years of association minutes and the sticker register and the daily riders to see how things have been handled and who is actually using the bikes.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the account from the neighbouring block's secretary and last year's complaint log entries to see how other buildings handle this and what the friction points are.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'll check the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the trial of the supplier's display frame to see how much work the management takes!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Does anyone else think we should consider the physical layout more, or are we satisfied with these choices for now?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I think we have covered the physical, financial, and historical aspects sufficiently for a first pass. Let's proceed with these.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree. We have a broad range of data points here, so there is no need to overlap our efforts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,It seems efficient. No point in doubling up when we have so many different angles to cover. Let's just get the facts.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see what we find! Let's get to it and share our discoveries in the next round.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm satisfied with the current distribution of tasks. I'll start reviewing the documents immediately.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will do the same. It is better to be thorough with the records before we start suggesting changes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll do the same. I'm curious to see if the complaints are as systemic as they seem.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'll go check those files right now. See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
